{{Kyoto School}}
{{Nihongo|The Logic of Basho|場所の論理|Basho no ronri}} is a philosophical concept associated with the [[Kyoto School]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=2016-12-20 |title=THE LOGIC OF BASHO |url=https://archive.ph/wip/e1Ab1 |access-date=2023-06-07 |website=The Kyoto School of Philosophy |language=en}}</ref>
