/files/P57-61.pdf</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last=Wargo |first=R. |date=1972 |title=The logic of Basho and the concept of nothingness in the philosophy of Nishida Kitarō |s2cid=169320125 |url=https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/The-logic-of-Basho-and-the-concept-of-nothingness-Wargo/cb25d3bf83fff496ce2df769a7452b32cc3cdad7}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=What is "basho" in Kitaro Nishida's philosophy? |url=https://philosophy.stackexchange.com/questions/89294/what-is-basho-in-kitaro-nishida-s-philosophy |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=Philosophy Stack Exchange |language=en}}</ref> * <ref>{{Cite web |title=The Logic of Nothingness: A Study of Nishida Kitaro (Na… |url=https://www.goodreads.com/work/689507-logic-of-nothingness-a-study-of-nishida-kitaro-nanzan-library-of-asian |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=Goodreads |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Hanks |first1=William F. |last2=Ide |first2=Sachiko |last3=Katagiri |first3=Yasuhiro |last4=Saft |first4=Scott |last5=Fujii |first5=Yoko |last6=Ueno |first6=Kishiko |date=2019-05-01 |title=Communicative interaction in terms of ba theory: Towards an innovative approach to language practice |url=https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0378216618306222 |journal=Journal of Pragmatics |series=Quo Vadis, Pragmatics? |language=en |volume=145 |pages=63–71 |doi=10.1016/j.pragma.2019.03.013 |s2cid=155749281 |issn=0378-2166}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last=Zavala |first=Agustín Jacinto |date=2012 |title=Heidegger in Nishida Philosophy |url=http://pepsic.bvsalud.org/scielo.php?script=sci_abstract&pid=S1517-24302012000100005&lng=pt&nrm=iso&tlng=en |journal=Natureza Humana |language=en |volume=14 |issue=1 |pages=72–100 |issn=1517-2430}}</ref> * <ref>https://www.cityu.edu.hk/sites/g/files/asqsls5796/files/2021-05/Nishida%E2%80%99s%20Logic%20of%20Creation.pdf</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=THE LOGIC OF BASHO AND THE CONCEPT OF NOTHINGNESS IN THE PHILOSOPHY OF NISHIDA KITARO - ProQuest |url=https://www.proquest.com/ope